Year = {2025},
Volume = {116},
Month = {JUL},
Abstract = {Integrated digital diagnostics are transforming complex surgical
   procedures, with brain tumour surgery being among the most challenging.
   STRATUM, a five-year Horizon Europe-funded project, aims to develop an
   advanced 3D decision support system leveraging real-time multimodal data
   processing powered by artificial intelligence. A key innovation of
   STRATUM is its design as an energy-efficient Point-of-Care computing
   system, seamlessly integrated into neurosurgical workflows. This system
   will provide surgeons with real-time, AI-driven insights, enhancing
   decision-making accuracy and efficiency. By optimizing surgical
   precision and reducing procedure duration, STRATUM is expected to
   improve patient outcomes while streamlining resource utilization within
   European healthcare systems.},
