   Uncertainty; Sensors; Three-dimensional displays; Tactile sensors;
   Feature extraction; Reconstruction algorithms; Convolutional neural
   network (CNN) and transformer; incremental tactile; multisensor fusion;
   uncertainty-driven sampling; visual-tactile fusion},
